{"seq":1,"slug":"trq-in-out-two-tier-rate","title":"TRQ 配额内/配额外的两档税率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/tariff-rate-quota/trq-in-out-two-tier-rate","wordCount":1685,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"trq-配额内-配额外的两档税率\">TRQ 配额内/配额外的两档税率</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>关税配额（Tariff-Rate Quota, TRQ）是&quot;<strong>数量限制的关税化形态</strong>&quot;：对同一税号、同一原产国的货物，规定一个数量额度，<strong>额度以内</strong>适用较低的&quot;配额内税率&quot;（in-quota rate，常为零或很低），<strong>超出额度</strong>的部分适用较高的&quot;配额外税率&quot;（over-quota rate，往往接近甚至高于原有关税）。它不禁止进口，只改变进口的边际成本——这是它与绝对配额、进口禁令的根本区别，也是它在工程上必须被当作&quot;<strong>两档税率的切换</strong>&quot;而非&quot;禁限量&quot;来实现的原因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"两档税率的法律来源\">两档税率的法律来源</h3><p>TRQ 的量化根源在 WTO《农业协定》。该协定第 4 条第 2 款确立了&quot;关税化&quot;纪律：成员&quot;不得维持、诉诸或恢复&quot;任何已被要求转化为普通关税的措施，脚注明确列举了这些被禁止的非关税措施——&quot;数量进口限制、可变进口税、最低进口价格、<strong>自由裁量进口许可</strong>&quot;以及自愿出口限制等。第 4 条同时允许成员的减让表中包含&quot;其他市场准入承诺&quot;，TRQ 正是这类承诺的载体。见 <a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/docs_e/legal_e/14-ag_01_e.htm\">WTO Agreement on Agriculture</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与绝对配额的分野\">与绝对配额的分野</h3><p>TRQ 与绝对配额（absolute quota）的区别不是程度而是性质：绝对配额在数量耗尽时<strong>禁止进口</strong>，TRQ 在数量耗尽时<strong>只提高税率</strong>，货物仍可进入。这条差异决定了系统边界——TRQ 不需要&quot;拒绝报关&quot;的能力，只需要&quot;切换税率档位&quot;的能力；而绝对配额必须实现到货拦截与退运流程。多数现代关税体系已把数量限制关税化，因此工程中遇到的主要是 TRQ 形态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[进口申报: 税号 + 原产国] --&gt; B{该税号是否存在 TRQ}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[只按 MFN/协定税率]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{是否持有配额额度}&#10;    D --&gt;|持有且额度充足| E[配额内税率 in-quota]&#10;    D --&gt;|无额度| F[配额外税率 over-quota]&#10;    D --&gt;|持有但额度不足| G[部分内 + 部分外&lt;br/&gt;按数量拆分计税]&#10;    E --&gt; H[扣减配额余额]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; I[不扣减余额]&#10;    H --&gt; J[生成配额占用记录]\">graph TD\n    A[进口申报: 税号 + 原产国] --&gt; B{该税号是否存在 TRQ}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[只按 MFN/协定税率]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{是否持有配额额度}\n    D --&gt;|持有且额度充足| E[配额内税率 in-quota]\n    D --&gt;|无额度| F[配额外税率 over-quota]\n    D --&gt;|持有但额度不足| G[部分内 + 部分外&lt;br/&gt;按数量拆分计税]\n    E --&gt; H[扣减配额余额]\n    G --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; I[不扣减余额]\n    H --&gt; J[生成配额占用记录]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>适用税率</th>\n<th>配额扣减</th>\n<th>典型结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有额度、全额在额度内</td>\n<td>in-quota</td>\n<td>全额扣减</td>\n<td>最低成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有额度、超额部分</td>\n<td>拆分：内段 in-quota、外段 over-quota</td>\n<td>按内段扣减</td>\n<td>边际成本递增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无额度</td>\n<td>over-quota</td>\n<td>不扣减</td>\n<td>最高成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>额度已耗尽（exhausted）</td>\n<td>over-quota</td>\n<td>不扣减</td>\n<td>等同于无额度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键配额（critical）</td>\n<td>视状态，可能已耗尽</td>\n<td>视余额</td>\n<td>需实时查询余额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"配额内-外两档的计税实现\">配额内/外两档的计税实现</h2><h3 id=\"分段计税与税率形式的组合\">分段计税与税率形式的组合</h3><p>TRQ 的计税核心是&quot;<strong>按数量分段</strong>&quot;：对一票报关，先用可用额度覆盖尽可能多的数量，剩余部分按配额外税率。这与&quot;整票取一个税率&quot;有实质差别——不能因为额度只有一半就把整票按配额外征税。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"function quota_duty(order, entry):&#10;    quota = load_quota(order.quota_order_number, entry.origin, entry.date)&#10;&#10;    if quota is null or quota.status == &#39;EXHAUSTED&#39;:&#10;        return entry.quantity * order.over_quota_rate_value        # 全额配额外&#10;&#10;    if entry.quantity &lt;= quota.balance:&#10;        # 全额在额度内&#10;        return entry.quantity * order.in_quota_rate_value&#10;&#10;    # 分段：内段用配额内税率，外段用配额外税率&#10;    in_qty  = quota.balance&#10;    out_qty = entry.quantity - quota.balance&#10;    return in_qty * order.in_quota_rate_value&#10;         + out_qty * order.over_quota_rate_value\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function quota_duty(order, entry):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    quota = load_quota(order.quota_order_number, entry.origin, entry.date)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if quota is null or quota.status == 'EXHAUSTED':</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return entry.quantity * order.over_quota_rate_value        # 全额配额外</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if entry.quantity &#x3C;= quota.balance:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        # 全额在额度内</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return entry.quantity * order.in_quota_rate_value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 分段：内段用配额内税率，外段用配额外税率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    in_qty  = quota.balance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    out_qty = entry.quantity - quota.balance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return in_qty * order.in_quota_rate_value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         + out_qty * order.over_quota_rate_value</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意税率形式的组合：配额内档常常是从价税或零税，配额外档可能是从价、从量、或复合。因此 <code>in_quota_rate_value</code> 与 <code>over_quota_rate_value</code> 各自需要 <code>rate_form</code> 字段，不能假设两者同形。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据模型-配额键不能只有一个维度\">数据模型：配额键不能只有一个维度</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE tariff_rate_quota (&#10;  quota_order_number TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  hs_code            TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  origin_country     TEXT NOT NULL,      -- &#39;ALL&#39; 表示不区分来源&#10;  quota_period_start DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  quota_period_end   DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  quota_total_qty    NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  quota_unit         TEXT NOT NULL,      -- kg / pcs / L / pair&#10;  in_quota_rate_form  TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (in_quota_rate_form IN (&#39;AD_VALOREM&#39;,&#39;SPECIFIC&#39;,&#39;FREE&#39;)),&#10;  in_quota_rate_value NUMERIC(9,4),&#10;  over_quota_rate_form TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (over_quota_rate_form IN (&#39;AD_VALOREM&#39;,&#39;SPECIFIC&#39;,&#39;COMPOUND&#39;)),&#10;  over_quota_rate_value NUMERIC(9,4),&#10;  management_method  TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (management_method IN&#10;                       (&#39;FCFS&#39;,&#39;LICENCE&#39;,&#39;HISTORICAL&#39;,&#39;AUCTION&#39;,&#39;SIMULTANEOUS&#39;)),&#10;  critical_flag      BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE quota_balance (&#10;  quota_order_number TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES tariff_rate_quota(quota_order_number),&#10;  origin_country     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  consumed_qty       NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  allocated_qty      NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  last_updated_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (quota_order_number, origin_country)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tariff_rate_quota</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quota_order_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hs_code            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  origin_country     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'ALL' 表示不区分来源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quota_period_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quota_period_end   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quota_total_qty    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quota_unit         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- kg / pcs / L / pair</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  in_quota_rate_form  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (in_quota_rate_form </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AD_VALOREM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SPECIFIC'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FREE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  in_quota_rate_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  over_quota_rate_form </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (over_quota_rate_form </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AD_VALOREM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SPECIFIC'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'COMPOUND'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  over_quota_rate_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  management_method  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (management_method </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                       (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FCFS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LICENCE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HISTORICAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AUCTION'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SIMULTANEOUS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  critical_flag      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> quota_balance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quota_order_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tariff_rate_quota(quota_order_number),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  origin_country     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  consumed_qty       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  allocated_qty      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  last_updated_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (quota_order_number, origin_country)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 <code>quota_total_qty</code> 与 <code>quota_balance.consumed_qty</code> 分开、并按 <code>(quota_order_number, origin_country)</code> 建键，是这套模型的关键：<strong>同一配额通常在原产国之间有份额划分</strong>，把余额按配额号单一维度记录会导致跨国争抢额度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"配额管理方式-fcfs-许可与历史分配\">配额管理方式：FCFS、许可与历史分配</h2><p>两档税率只是结果，真正决定&quot;能不能拿到额度&quot;的是<strong>管理方式</strong>。常见方式及其工程含义如下。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>管理方式</th>\n<th>取得机制</th>\n<th>余额可预测性</th>\n<th>对报关时点的要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>先来先得（FCFS）</td>\n<td>按报关受理顺序扣减</td>\n<td>低（随时可能耗尽）</td>\n<td>极高：需实时余额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>许可/配额证（LICENCE）</td>\n<td>先申请取得证件，报关时出示</td>\n<td>高（已锁定）</td>\n<td>中：证件有效期约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史分配（HISTORICAL）</td>\n<td>按以往进口业绩分配</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拍卖（AUCTION）</td>\n<td>竞价取得</td>\n<td>中（价格已知）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同时审查（SIMULTANEOUS）</td>\n<td>申请期内统一审查分配</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>FCFS 对系统要求最苛刻：<strong>配额余额是竞争性资源，扣减必须是原子的</strong>。两个并发报关同时读到&quot;余额 100&quot;并各自扣减，会把额度超发。正确做法是&quot;以配额号 + 原产国为行锁的扣减&quot;，并在扣减失败时明确回退到配额外税率而非失败重试。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 原子扣减：FCFS 场景下的并发安全&#10;BEGIN;&#10;SELECT consumed_qty FROM quota_balance&#10; WHERE quota_order_number = $1 AND origin_country = $2&#10; FOR UPDATE;&#10;&#10;UPDATE quota_balance&#10;   SET consumed_qty = consumed_qty + $3,&#10;       last_updated_at = now()&#10; WHERE quota_order_number = $1 AND origin_country = $2&#10;   AND consumed_qty + $3 &lt;= (SELECT quota_total_qty FROM tariff_rate_quota&#10;                              WHERE quota_order_number = $1);&#10;-- 若影响行数为 0，说明余额不足：按配额外税率计税，不重试&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 原子扣减：FCFS 场景下的并发安全</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> consumed_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_balance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_order_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> origin_country </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_balance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> consumed_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> consumed_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       last_updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_order_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> origin_country </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> consumed_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_total_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tariff_rate_quota</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                              WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_order_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 若影响行数为 0，说明余额不足：按配额外税率计税，不重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>许可制（LICENCE）下，余额在申请阶段就被&quot;分配&quot;出去，报关阶段只是&quot;消耗已分配额度&quot;，因此需要区分 <code>allocated_qty</code>（已分配）与 <code>consumed_qty</code>（已消耗）两个字段——见 <a href=\"quota-license-certificate-manage\">配额证/许可证件管理与占用</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-关键配额-状态的关系\">与&quot;关键配额&quot;状态的关系</h2><p>EU 的配额查询系统把每个配额标注为&quot;关键&quot;（critical）与非关键两种状态，状态字段的取值即为&quot;Blocked / Exhausted / Not blocked / Not exhausted&quot;。见 <a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/dds2/taric/quota_consultation.jsp\">EU TARIC 配额查询</a>。&quot;关键&quot;标记的含义是<strong>该配额消耗速度异常、预计在期内提前耗尽</strong>，因此被列为需密切监控的对象。</p>\n<p>对工程的含义是：<code>critical_flag</code> 不应只用于展示，而应驱动<strong>采购与报关时点决策</strong>——关键配额意味着&quot;晚两周报关可能就从配额内掉到配额外&quot;，采购计划需要把这个时间敏感性写进去。这与 <a href=\"quota-balance-allocation-order\">配额余额查询/申请与下单占用</a> 的调度逻辑是同一件事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"trq-与救济税的关系-不要混淆两类-加征\">TRQ 与救济税的关系：不要混淆两类&quot;加征&quot;</h2><p>TRQ 与 ADD/CVD 都会让同一税号的实际税负变高，但性质完全不同，且在同一票货上可能<strong>同时适用</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比项</th>\n<th>TRQ 配额外档</th>\n<th>ADD/CVD</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>性质</td>\n<td>减让表内的两档承诺</td>\n<td>针对不公平贸易的救济</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否区分厂商</td>\n<td>否（按配额号 + 原产国）</td>\n<td>是（逐厂商）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否可豁免</td>\n<td>取得额度即可回到低档</td>\n<td>价格承诺、豁免裁定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据主键</td>\n<td>(quota_order_number, origin, period)</td>\n<td>(order_id, producer_id)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否受日落复审</td>\n<td>否（按减让表周期性谈判调整）</td>\n<td>是（5 年日落）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否产生保证金</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>临时措施下是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两者叠加时，正确顺序是：先确定 TRQ 档位（决定基础税率），再把 ADD/CVD 叠加其上——见 <a href=\"../remedy-determination-engine/remedy-duty-stack-order-engine\">救济税与常规/协定税的叠加顺序</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>TRQ 是&quot;两档税率的切换&quot;而非禁限量：配额内适用低档、配额外适用高档，超额部分按数量<strong>分段计税</strong>。</li>\n<li>计税不能&quot;整票取一个税率&quot;；必须按可用余额拆分为内段与外段。</li>\n<li>配额键是 <code>(配额号, 原产国, 期间)</code>，同一配额常在原产国间划分份额，余额不能按配额号单维度记录。</li>\n<li>FCFS 管理方式下余额扣减必须是<strong>原子操作 + 行锁</strong>，扣减失败即回退配额外税率，绝不重试。</li>\n<li>许可制需区分&quot;已分配&quot;与&quot;已消耗&quot;两个量；&quot;关键配额&quot;标记应驱动报关时点决策，而不只是展示。</li>\n<li>TRQ 与 ADD/CVD 性质不同、可同时适用，顺序是先定档位再叠加救济税。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"TRQ 配额内/配额外的两档税率","id":"trq-配额内-配额外的两档税率"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"两档税率的法律来源","id":"两档税率的法律来源"},{"level":3,"text":"与绝对配额的分野","id":"与绝对配额的分野"},{"level":2,"text":"配额内/外两档的计税实现","id":"配额内-外两档的计税实现"},{"level":3,"text":"分段计税与税率形式的组合","id":"分段计税与税率形式的组合"},{"level":3,"text":"数据模型：配额键不能只有一个维度","id":"数据模型-配额键不能只有一个维度"},{"level":2,"text":"配额管理方式：FCFS、许可与历史分配","id":"配额管理方式-fcfs-许可与历史分配"},{"level":2,"text":"与\"关键配额\"状态的关系","id":"与-关键配额-状态的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"TRQ 与救济税的关系：不要混淆两类\"加征\"","id":"trq-与救济税的关系-不要混淆两类-加征"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"救济税与常规/协定税的叠加顺序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/remedy-determination-engine/remedy-duty-stack-order-engine"},"next":{"title":"配额证与许可证件的管理与占用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/tariff-rate-quota/quota-license-certificate-manage"}}